; Wire Drift Racers original sound effects.
; t300 maps a sixteenth note to three 60 Hz frames.
@gain 8

@effect CONFIRM 1 0x0c 0x10 1 0x24 0x18
t300 v15 o5 l16 g+16 o6 b4
@end

@effect CANCEL 2 0x00 0x14 1 0x04 0x18
t300 v15 o4 a8 e8
@end

@effect SELECT 4 0x00 0x12 1 0x00 0x16
t300 v15 o6 e16 a16 o7 c+16
@end

@effect COUNTDOWN 2 0x00 0x12 1 0x00 0x12
t300 v15 o6 a4
@end

@effect START 3 0x18 0x10 1 0x10 0x10
t300 v15 o4 b16 o5 g+16 o6 f8 o7 d4
@end

@effect BOOST 3 0x08 0x10 1 0x20 0x18
t300 v15 o4 f16 o5 d16 b16 o6 g+16
@end

@effect DRIFT 5 0x10 0x1c 2 0x18 0x16
t300 v15 o4 d16 b16 o5 g+16 o6 f16 o7 d8
@end

@effect TACKLE 1 0x00 0x18 1 0x00 0x1f
t300 v15 o3 c8 g8
@end

@effect WALL 7 0x04 0x1f 6 0x0c 0x1f
t300 v15 o4 d16 o3 d16 o4 g+16 o3 f16 o5 d16
@end

@effect GATE 2 0x0c 0x14 1 0x26 0x18
t300 v15 o4 g+16 o5 g+16 o6 b8
@end

@effect SLIPSTREAM 4 0x18 0x0c 1 0x30 0x14
t300 v15 o3 b16 o4 f16 o5 d8
@end
